@baseUrl = http://localhost:9980
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@username = admin
# 客户端约定：密码传 SHA-256(明文) 十六进制；下面是 "123456" 的 SHA-256
@passwordSha256 = 8d969eef6ecad3c29a3a629280e686cf0c3f5d5a86aff3ca12020c923adc6c92

### 1. 登录（移动端，免验证码）—— 取 accessToken
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/mobile/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{passwordSha256}}",
  "deviceNo": "verify-script"
}

### 2. 校验金蝶 access_token（期望 active=true、expiresInMs>0）
GET {{api}}/integration/kingdee/master-data/token/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. 只读探测内码字段键（不写库；验证 FMATERIALID 是否可查）
POST {{api}}/integration/kingdee/master-data/probe?formId=BD_MATERIAL&fieldKeys=FNumber,FMATERIALID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
